		"Type": "VisualScript"
	},
	"VisualScript": {
		"Description": "Counts its entity's contacts: collisions and triggers that begin and end. At the first contact that ends, it checks that every contact that ended had begun (Checks counts it) and sets Done. The feature test's falling box and ball run it next to their C# CollisionProbe. Its custom event Ping adds its Amount to Pings: Features.sgraph sends it to the box, broadcasts it to both and reads and writes Pings from there.",
